~ p5_creature_seen
Emily: It's there. In front of the door. [#thought]
Emily: It's been following me this whole time. [#thought]
=> END

~ p5_face_it
Emily: You were never trying to hurt me, were you? [#thought]
Emily: You're everything I couldn't say. Everything I carried. [#thought]
Emily: I don't have to run from you anymore. [#thought]
=> END

~ p5_accepted
Emily: ...Okay. [#thought]
Emily: The door. I can go now. [#thought]
=> END